config BR2_PACKAGE_PORTMASTER_THEORA_COMPAT
	bool "portmaster theora 1.1 compatibility"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBOGG
	help
	  libtheora 1.1.1 decoder, installed only under /usr/lib/compat.
	  PortMaster LÖVE 11.5 was built against libtheoradec.so.1.
	  The system libtheora stays 1.2 (libtheoradec.so.2). This is
	  not a system Theora downgrade.

	  https://downloads.xiph.org/releases/theora/
